{"id": "environmental-health-inspection-fees", "title": "Environmental Health struggled to track repeat inspections and fees", "seconds": 68.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.024, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "771271fab188bef7", "words": 154, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Controller found that four Environmental Health programs missed some required inspections.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.87, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Inspections", "and", "fees"], "sub": "Environmental Health"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.74, 1.02, 1.21, 1.55, 2.3, 2.6, 3.62, 3.92, 4.18, 4.83]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Some facilities went longer than the required or recommended interval without inspection.", "t0": 5.99, "t1": 10.59, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "2018 audit", "mark": "2018 audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.91, 1.17, 1.53, 1.68, 1.8, 2.39, 2.59, 3.14, 3.56, 3.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The branch also conducted reinspections inconsistently and did not fully recover program costs.", "t0": 10.71, "t1": 17.57, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reinspections"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 1.03, 1.59, 2.58, 4.15, 4.47, 4.63, 4.89, 5.31, 5.76, 6.23]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The audit examined fees assessed in calendar 2016.", "t0": 17.69, "t1": 21.34, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Calendar 2016 assessments", "mark": "Calendar 2016 assessments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.56, 1.13, 1.65, 2.08, 2.2, 2.62, 2.94]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]", "amount"], "text": "Uncollected fees came to 761,344 dollars.", "t0": 21.46, "t1": 27.81, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$761,344", "label": "Outstanding on calendar 2016 assessments in four programs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.77, 1.26, 1.59, 1.74, 2.1, 2.69, 3.5, 4.37, 4.74, 5.13, 5.76]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Food Safety accounted for the largest amount, followed by Housing.", "t0": 27.93, "t1": 32.02, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Two of four programs", "heading": "Uncollected assessments", "source": "original", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Food Safety", "value": "$533,211"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Housing", "value": "$196,141"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.9, 1.36, 1.5, 1.64, 2.11, 3.02, 3.43, 3.6]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In March 2023, eight of 15 recommendations had been implemented.", "t0": 32.24, "t1": 36.83, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "field", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "March 2023 field review", "mark": "March 2023 field review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.57, 0.87, 2.09, 2.33, 2.44, 2.94, 3.73, 3.86, 4.02]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "One was closed as inapplicable. Six were still open.", "t0": 36.95, "t1": 40.5, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "March field review", "heading": "Status of fifteen recommendations", "source": "field", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "Implemented", "value": "8"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Closed as inapplicable", "value": "1"}, {"icon": "gap", "label": "Still open", "value": "6"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.4, 0.83, 0.98, 2.2, 2.67, 2.88, 3.18]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The recommendation on billing for reinspections was only partially implemented.", "t0": 40.62, "t1": 45.37, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reinspection billing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.94, 1.14, 1.6, 1.81, 3.03, 3.25, 3.51, 4.1]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The branch had started prioritizing facilities with failing results.", "t0": 45.49, "t1": 49.84, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "field", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "Risk-based inspections", "mark": "Risk-based inspections"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.71, 1.09, 1.97, 2.98, 3.23, 3.65]}, {"scene": "closed", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In February 2024, the Controller listed the 2018 audit as closed.", "t0": 50.06, "t1": 55.51, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closed", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "February 2024 report", "mark": "February 2024 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.84, 1.15, 2.24, 2.39, 2.92, 3.33, 3.44, 3.78, 4.27, 4.65, 4.84]}, {"scene": "closed", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "That closure was listed for the second half of 2023.", "t0": 55.63, "t1": 59.38, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "July through December 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.68, 0.86, 1.29, 1.43, 1.59, 2.01, 2.59, 2.78, 3.08]}, {"scene": "closed", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The reports do not establish how much of the historical balance was later collected.", "t0": 59.5, "t1": 64.41, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Later collections", "Required inspections"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.67, 0.84, 1.03, 1.67, 1.91, 2.26, 2.36, 2.49, 3.06, 3.82, 4.06, 4.38]}, {"scene": "closed", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 64.53, "t1": 67.12, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.9, 1.08, 1.38, 1.46, 1.56, 1.82, 2.12]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Inspections and fees", "followup": "The field review", "closed": "Later status"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "timeline"}